  "description": "PIWJOW crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H95 Gd3 N8 O15 2+,C54 H87 Gd3 N10 O19,6(C1 H4 O1),2(N1 O3 1-). From the CIF bond table, Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd3A (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.546-3.575 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.48-97.48°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C54H95Gd3N10O23. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
